{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 83,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        66.95471954345703,
        174.74769592285156,
        82.6147232055664
      ],
      "text": "Extrapulmonary TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        89.82263946533203,
        527.4376831054688,
        104.26564025878906
      ],
      "text": "Patients with extrapulmonary TB were excluded from the ZeNix and TB-PRACTECAL trials; therefore,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        103.02259063720703,
        527.2299194335938,
        117.46559143066406
      ],
      "text": "no analysis specific to this subgroup of patients could be performed. The available data on the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        116.22272491455078,
        527.2867431640625,
        130.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "central nervous system (CNS) penetration of bedaquiline or pretomanid are limited. Although all",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.42274475097656,
        527.4476928710938,
        143.86573791503906
      ],
      "text": "forms of extrapulmonary TB were excluded from the clinical trials, the GDG felt that extrapolation to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        142.62269592285156,
        527.4519653320312,
        157.06568908691406
      ],
      "text": "extrapulmonary TB and other forms of TB was warranted except in cases involving severe forms of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.8227081298828,
        527.6151733398438,
        170.2657012939453
      ],
      "text": "TB that may require special treatment arrangements and decisions, particularly TB involving the CNS,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99174690246582,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        169.02272033691406,
        527.5214233398438,
        183.46571350097656
      ],
      "text": "osteoarticular and disseminated forms of TB. Thus, the recommendation of the BPaLM/BPaL regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98969554901123,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        182.2227325439453,
        527.4401245117188,
        196.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "applies to people with pulmonary TB and all forms of extrapulmonary TB except for TB involving the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        195.42274475097656,
        324.2577819824219,
        209.86573791503906
      ],
      "text": "CNS, and osteoarticular and disseminated forms of TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        223.23989868164062,
        245.23455810546875,
        239.09188842773438
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        246.29994201660156,
        527.4443969726562,
        260.7429504394531
      ],
      "text": "High treatment success rates shown for the BPaLM and BPaL regimens in the Nix-TB study and in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        259.4998779296875,
        527.4134521484375,
        273.9429016113281
      ],
      "text": "the ZeNix and TB-PRACTECAL trials, and favourable comparison with the current SoC regimens led",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        272.69989013671875,
        527.4155883789062,
        287.1429138183594
      ],
      "text": "to thorough discussions during the GDG meeting of an overall recommendation for implementation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        285.89990234375,
        527.4323120117188,
        300.3429260253906
      ],
      "text": "under routine programmatic conditions and of the implementation considerations for this regimen.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        299.09979248046875,
        527.1765747070312,
        313.5428161621094
      ],
      "text": "Given that this recommendation is conditional, the results of additional or ongoing operational",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        312.2999267578125,
        527.4498901367188,
        326.7429504394531
      ],
      "text": "research will help to add further knowledge that can be used to adjust and improve implementation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.4999084472656,
        189.97518920898438,
        339.94293212890625
      ],
      "text": "guidance for the regimen.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        356.3437194824219,
        163.87451171875,
        372.00372314453125
      ],
      "text": "Patient selection",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        379.2117004394531,
        527.4403076171875,
        393.65472412109375
      ],
      "text": "Overall, to reproduce the treatment success rates observed in the ZeNix and TB-PRACTECAL trials, it",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999950408935547,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        392.4117126464844,
        527.4323120117188,
        406.854736328125
      ],
      "text": "is important to carefully select eligible patients. Once those patients are enrolled, it is also important",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        405.6116943359375,
        527.4627685546875,
        420.0547180175781
      ],
      "text": "to provide effective patient support to enable adherence to treatment. It is also important to maintain",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.979981422424316,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        418.81170654296875,
        527.1803588867188,
        433.2547302246094
      ],
      "text": "close monitoring for AEs, response to treatment and emerging drug resistance, and to properly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        432.01171875,
        475.423095703125,
        446.4547424316406
      ],
      "text": "manage adverse drug reactions and prevent complications from drug–drug interactions.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        453.7156066894531,
        527.3927001953125,
        468.15863037109375
      ],
      "text": "The selection of patients is best aligned with the eligibility criteria of two trials (also reflected in the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        466.9156188964844,
        527.3621215820312,
        481.358642578125
      ],
      "text": "subgroup consideration above). The patients that can be enrolled on the BPaLM/BPaL regimen should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.967101097106934,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        480.1156005859375,
        497.723388671875,
        494.5586242675781
      ],
      "text": "have bacteriologically confirmed MDR/RR-TB, with or without resistance to fluoroquinolones.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        510.95953369140625,
        213.38893127441406,
        526.6195678710938
      ],
      "text": "Drug susceptibility testing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        533.827392578125,
        527.569091796875,
        548.2703857421875
      ],
      "text": "It is important to pay attention to the previous use and susceptibility status of the medicines comprising",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.950990676879883,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        547.0274047851562,
        527.4334106445312,
        561.4703979492188
      ],
      "text": "this regimen. Patients with a known history of more than 1 month use of bedaquiline, pretomanid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        560.2274169921875,
        527.5665893554688,
        574.67041015625
      ],
      "text": "(or delamanid, given some degree of cross-resistance) and linezolid should not be enrolled on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        573.4273681640625,
        527.5905151367188,
        587.870361328125
      ],
      "text": "this regimen, unless the results of recent DST of these medicines has confirmed susceptibility. In",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        586.62744140625,
        527.2857055664062,
        601.0704345703125
      ],
      "text": "cases where there is no prior use of these medicines or confirmed susceptibility, fluoroquinolone",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        599.827392578125,
        527.6378173828125,
        614.2703857421875
      ],
      "text": "resistance testing should also be done before the start of treatment. However, fluoroquinolone",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        613.0275268554688,
        527.3804321289062,
        627.4705200195312
      ],
      "text": "resistance testing should not delay treatment initiation (e.g. in cases where this DST is not available",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        626.2274169921875,
        527.4035034179688,
        640.67041015625
      ],
      "text": "or results are delayed). When DST results confirm fluoroquinolone susceptibility, treatment can be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        639.3173828125,
        527.3344116210938,
        653.870361328125
      ],
      "text": "In cases of fluoroquinolone resistance, moxifloxacin should  continued without any modifications.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.967501640319824,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        652.5174560546875,
        527.4161376953125,
        667.0704345703125
      ],
      "text": "be dropped and the regimen continued as the BPaL combination only.  This modification may",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        665.827392578125,
        527.3894653320312,
        680.2703857421875
      ],
      "text": "seem counterintuitive, because patients with TB that is resistant to an increased number of drugs will",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        679.0275268554688,
        527.4420776367188,
        693.4705200195312
      ],
      "text": "receive fewer TB medicines. However, moxifloxacin is unlikely to provide a benefit in the presence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        692.2274169921875,
        527.4322509765625,
        706.67041015625
      ],
      "text": "of fluoroquinolone resistance and the BPaL regimen has been shown to have high efficacy without",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        705.4274291992188,
        527.4188842773438,
        719.8704223632812
      ],
      "text": "moxifloxacin. In the context of fluoroquinolone resistance, omitting moxifloxacin will help to avoid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        718.6273803710938,
        527.4334106445312,
        733.0703735351562
      ],
      "text": "potential toxicity related to this medicine. Conversely, in the absence of fluoroquinolone resistance,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        731.827392578125,
        527.363037109375,
        746.2703857421875
      ],
      "text": "the use of moxifloxacin further increases the efficacy of the regimen and may provide protection",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        745.0275268554688,
        527.4013671875,
        759.4705200195312
      ],
      "text": "against acquired bedaquiline resistance, and thus is recommended. If fluoroquinolone DST results",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        330.23760986328125,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 2 Drug-resistant TB treatment: Recommendations  69",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}